  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food System Myths Busters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to produce a &#x2018;myths busters&#x2019; set of brief papers to unmask and dismantle some of the myths behind the dominant industrial agriculture food system model. It builds in part on the approach of the coal, oil, gas and poverty briefings that various agencies produced to make the case that fossil fuel development is not needed to tackle poverty. 

IDS has been contracted to deliver the core research and initial briefing papers. Other activities such as communications work, will be developed after delivery of the briefings.</narrative>
  </description>
